      "statusChangeID": "645c835585674808fe224105",
      "statusChangeNewStatus": "closed",
      "value": "If that channel were closed, then AI generated images would have no place to be posted except in other channels intended for images that aren't generated by AI.\n\nI would expect, at that point, the ask to be \"please ban AI generated images from this Discord!\" which isn't what we want to do, and is not feasible for us to enforce.\n\nI would encourage you to mute the channel if you do not personally want to see it.\n\nFinally, Feature Requests isn't for posts like this, although admittedly I'm unsure where this post *should* go.\n\nHowever, I *do* think the channel name \"AI art\" may be unnecessarily inflammatory so I have renamed the channel for accuracy to \"ai-content\".\n\nAnyhow, I'll be closing this request as we won't be acting on it.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
