      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{5acad9ecc9dba010c9c3ec68|full_name}: I seriously hope you're not saying VRChat is encouraging generative AI, because that's the vibes I'm getting from this. At least don't delve deeper into AI, *please*. If VRChat can't gracefully pull out, fine, just don't make things worse.\n\n\"Just don't look at it :D\" isn't making things better when the issue is VRChat is actively encouraging people to post it.",
