      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{58c6b8ad227a56787575ebbd|full_name}: You've misrepresented my post completely.\n\nI am not encouraging it, I am providing a containment chamber. If  no such chamber is provided, there is no way for people that do not want to see it (like you) to avoid it, as users would post to other media channels.\n\nAt that point, the only choice to prevent the images from being shown would be to ban them completely, which is not what I want to do and is simply not feasible.\n\nThere is no encouragement here, only organization and compartmentalization.\n\nI apologize if this is insufficient for your needs. My initial goal was to implement the method that allows people who wish to employ tools like generative networks to make content to post it, and also to allow users who do not want to see it an easy way to avoid it by prompting the former group to put everything into one place.\n\nAs a side note, I also don't appreciate being depicted as aloof when I am doing my best to address a subject I take seriously without just saying \"no, not allowed, get out\" to a segment of users who want to post something otherwise totally permitted by all of our guidelines and rules.\n\nIf you can provide an alternate method that has more coverage for all use cases for **all** users -- not just one viewpoint -- I am all ears.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    }
  ],
  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2023-05-10T09:28:30.528Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "From what I've seen, VRChat respects and celebrates its creators. Having the ai-art channel up goes against it. Generative image AI tech is built on unethical grounds and has no place on this platform in my opinion.\n\nI find it extremely inappropriate VRChat would give a place for people to share and discuss a tech that actively is damaging actual artists by stealing their copyrighted works and benefiting from it, I'm not asking for a total ban just that VRChat stops giving it a thumbs up and keep being respectful to its userbase (Like when you banned NFT/crypto <3).",
